  <wpt lat="33.74407" lon="134.556272">
    <name>Ebisuhama Ohenro Rest Hut</name>
    <type>campsite</type>
    <desc>Camp spot (Free)
恵比須浜おへんろ休憩所
Purpose-built pilgrim rest hut at Ebisuhama on the T22→T23 coast road, ~2.5km before Hiwasa. 2022 nojuku candidate. Sea-facing/windy. Paid Ebisuhama Camp Village ~200m south if you&apos;d rather pay.
Source: mititabi.com 2022; OSM (2022)</desc>
