    <name>Oi Pilgrim Rest Area</name>
    <type>hut</type>
    <desc>Hut - sleepable (unofficial - be discreet, ask if possible)
四国のみち 大井休憩所
https://www.henro.org/place/oi-pilgrim-rest-area
--- research (2022): Free / Closed school opened to walking pilgrims by local residents&apos; assoc - the standard camp between T20 Kakurinji (~3km) and T21 Tairyuji (~4km). Sleep under gym eaves; water + toilets. Rules: do NOT enter classrooms, NO fires, pack out rubbish. No booking.
Source: mitizoi.exblog.jp/15376328; mititabi.com 2022</desc>
  </wpt>
