    <desc>Hut - sleeping ALLOWED
CAVEAT: posted notice says overnight only in emergencies; pilgrims do sleep here but not officially sanctioned. Cold/exposed.
柳水庵休憩所
https://www.henro.org/place/ryusuian-rest-area-kamiyama-tokushima
Features: Futon, Outlets
--- research (2022): Free / Unmanned hut at Ryusui-an, halfway on the T11→T12 Shosanji mountain crossing (~8km from Fujiidera). Electricity, spring water, toilet. CAVEAT: posted notice says overnight only in emergencies - pilgrims do sleep here but not officially sanctioned. Cold/exposed. Tent alternative ~4km on at Ipponsugi-an yamaban-goya (34.00759,134.30514).
Source: mititabi.com 2022 nojuku survey; henroseika.exblog.jp; OSM</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.071569" lon="134.550519">
    <name>Seifu Business Hotel</name>
    <type>accommodation</type>
    <desc>Budget hotel
ビジネスホテル 清風荘
https://www.henro.org/place/seifu-business-hotel
Features: Bidet, Bike rental, Body wash, Hair dryer, Iron, Kettle, Parking, Postal services, Shampoo, Towels, TV, WIFI, Yukata / bathrobe
Tel: 0886255708</desc>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="34.06859" lon="134.5467">
    <name>Shinmachi Onsen</name>
    <type>poi</type>
  </wpt>
