  <wpt lat="33.772771" lon="134.583838">
    <name>Tainohama Station Azumaya</name>
    <type>campsite</type>
    <desc>Camp spot (Free)
田井ノ浜駅前の東屋
Open pavilion at the seasonal JR Tainohama beach halt, T22→T23 leg. In the current Hagimori List (Feb 2026) as a free option; roof/water/toilet per 2022 survey. Beach toilets. Roof only, no walls.
Source: hagimorilist.com PDF 2026-02-18; mititabi.com 2022 (2026)</desc>
  </wpt>
